#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:2
msgid "How to support Unicode in Sphinx PDFs"
msgstr "如何在 Sphinx PDF 中支持 Unicode"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:4
msgid ""
"Sphinx offers different `LaTeX engines`_ that have better support for "
"Unicode characters, relevant for instance for Japanese or Chinese."
msgstr "Sphinx 提供不同的 `LaTeX engines`_ ，对 Unicode 字符支持更好，例如对日语或中文。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:9
msgid ""
"To build your documentation in PDF, you need to configure Sphinx properly in"
" your project's ``conf.py``. Read the Docs will execute the proper commands "
"depending on these settings. There are `several settings that can be "
"defined`_ (all the ones starting with ``latex_``), to modify Sphinx and Read"
" the Docs behavior to make your documentation to build properly."
msgstr ""
"要以 PDF 构建文档，需要在项目的 ``conf.py`` 中正确配置 Sphinx。Read the Docs 会根据这些设置执行相应命令。有 "
"`several settings that can be defined`_ （所有以 ``latex_`` 开头的设置），可调整 Sphinx 和 "
"Read the Docs 的行为使文档正确构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:16
msgid ""
"For docs that are not written in Chinese or Japanese, and if your build "
"fails from a Unicode error, then try ``xelatex`` as the ``latex_engine`` in "
"your ``conf.py``:"
msgstr ""
"若文档不是中日文撰写，且构建因 Unicode 错误失败，可在 ``conf.py`` 中将 ``latex_engine`` 设为 "
"``xelatex`` ："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:24
msgid ""
"When Read the Docs detects that your documentation is in Chinese or "
"Japanese, it automatically adds some defaults for you."
msgstr "当 Read the Docs 检测到你的文档是中文或日文时，会自动为你添加一些默认设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:27
msgid "For *Chinese* projects, it appends to your ``conf.py`` these settings:"
msgstr "对*中文* 项目，它会在你的 ``conf.py`` 中追加以下设置："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:37
msgid "And for *Japanese* projects:"
msgstr "对*日文* 项目则追加："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:46
msgid ""
"You can always override these settings if you define them by yourself in "
"your ``conf.py`` file."
msgstr "如果你在 ``conf.py`` 文件中自行定义了这些设置，始终可以覆盖它们。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pdf-non-ascii-languages.rst:50
msgid ""
"``xindy`` is currently not supported by Read the Docs, but we plan to "
"support it in the near future."
msgstr "Read the Docs 目前尚不支持 ``xindy`` ，但计划在不久的将来支持。"

